  "id": "positive-affect",
  "term": "positive affect",
  "definition": "Positive affect is the extent to which a person feels pleasant emotional states such as joy, happiness, interest, or alertness. It can shift with the situation and time, though some research also treats it as a more stable personal tendency.",
